<description>&lt;p&gt;Venezuela is moving to repeal the law that barred opposition figures from office and the Simón Bolívar law aimed at countering a U.S. blockade, while the National Assembly advances these changes. The WHO director-general made the first official visit to the country, pledging health support, and the United States and Qatar are working to clear regional development bank arrears. China and Russia have lost oil footholds worth $22 billion, and a fire at the Amuay refinery was contained without affecting fuel supply. The U.S. Senate is probing JD Vance’s alleged profit from a Venezuelan crude license, and 2 battle-related deaths occurred in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOZk56U1ppNndqeTVWb2FvZ1ktaVRZTEx0WENYTEFCMVR2Q2huWnJBbG11ek5IUVVmaVJqUjItSDNmZDlaTVNGNjhoa09Wd1E1OXNKbG85WGVTZGpvVVVSYW1iZEc0alF4Q3ZFb1hqYXdrVFd5SjVjbnp0MDZlZVNZam5HY1M2czV1SHFSV0dIcUFvV3U2Q1FhT0I0MGF2UzlPd3FhRXVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNYnZ1a0tWZGRjN19GNkZNS0JoYmlDZGNHSkVZMmM1d2xsTEN1QmhsNkZtWVZfelZCUzdid05hSkVYa0hNVmpRazY0MUtWdWJQR2FydkFUeWtqZUotbXVvQ1JPVWg2Y0tGdWZOQ0hHUkNLRGh6Nm5SMjBNVldmRm1YZU1iaG5DSjdaSmFTcXpIdDZwUExwOFQzNWxSMk1QV1NaWWVONy02Y2FSa2xZbV8wUWMtd0h1clBxZ01aYTdpd0xYYjZMXzVrVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE05RUgxMXB2Qm9ia3NEQi05a1V3bG4tbmxscjh5Q1hQc242YXhaSVg0RldkYlRpcEJNdlhTLWI4Zm1qNnBZNjNzYQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQOVM1VUN6WHpOcndwX2NQdkE3NHBSLXVUNkhER3l1c3FtUGZDb09vZVNMNkk5NDZmeUFSSXh0RFI3aWk0cUt4dzRwTDBBRnlXWGtVQVpuUzlVUHN6NUxBdHlWV05IQ0RWQlF4dUhTUm5LYTlEUXlhMTFsRlNHR